   "en": "The Gemara notes: «This» explanation of Rav Yirmeya bar Abba «is also taught» in a baraita: «Rabbi Yehuda says:» The term «anpikanon» is referring to «olive oil» produced from olives «that have not» yet «reached one-third» of their growth. And «why do» women «spread it» on their bodies? They do so «because it removes the hair and pampers the skin.»"
